    { "type": "text", "id": "shared_t", "x": 184, "y": 568, "width": 1672, "height": 96,
      "text": "Shared by reference across every branch  -  not copies\n\n   Metadata      StepResults      EventChannel      ServiceProvider      CorrelationId      Runtime\n\nThey are thread-safe collections, so concurrent writes will not corrupt them. They will still race.",
      "originalText": "Shared by reference across every branch  -  not copies\n\n   Metadata      StepResults      EventChannel      ServiceProvider      CorrelationId      Runtime\n\nThey are thread-safe collections, so concurrent writes will not corrupt them. They will still race.",
